 ### Sub-elements and named anchors
 
-A node can open a block holding *sub-elements* (compartments) and *anchors* (named points on a boundary); an edge end then references any of them by id:
+A node can open a block holding *sub-elements* (compartments) and *anchors* (named points on a boundary). An edge end then references any of them by id:
 
 ```mmd
