 <section id="overview">
+  <div class="label">01 · Start</div>
   <h2>Overview</h2>
   <p><strong>flowmaid</strong> is a diagram engine that speaks Mermaid syntax and is written in
   pure Rust with <strong>zero dependencies</strong> — no C libraries, no JavaScript runtime,
   nothing beyond the Rust standard library. Feed it Mermaid-like text, get back an SVG string
   or plain positioned geometry you can paint with any UI toolkit.</p>
